6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! It's over...</font>

26
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:59,510
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The  Reason  We</font>

27
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:59,510
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Won't  Lose</font>

28
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

29
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just barely...</font>

30
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a close one.</font>

31
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:14,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I was able to throw it off
just a little.</font>

32
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no mistake.</font>

33
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's now realized the secret
of the Byakugan.</font>

34
00:02:23,990 --> 00:02:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this?
How?!</font>

35
00:02:31,670 --> 00:02:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How was he able to throw it</font>

36
00:02:33,250 --> 00:02:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a whole six inches
from his vital point?!</font>

37
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... That Chakra!</font>

38
00:02:45,850 --> 00:02:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was emitting Chakra
the whole time</font>

39
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and covered the area surrounding him!</font>

40
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in a wide range to that extent.</font>

41
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder he was able
to detect the arrow and</font>

42
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">throw off the trajectory of it.</font>

43
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:10,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But constantly emitting that
much Chakra is a death throe...</font>

44
00:03:11,830 --> 00:03:14,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he doesn't go that far,
he can't dodge.</font>

45
00:03:14,340 --> 00:03:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, there's no mistake.</font>

46
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as I hypothesized...</font>

47
00:03:19,090 --> 00:03:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The arrow earlier was
totally invisible to him!</font>

48
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't carry out useless attacks...</font>

49
00:03:27,270 --> 00:03:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And from the results,
he accurately examines the information.</font>

50
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... he's also discovered
the weakness of my eyes...</font>

51
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impressive.</font>

52
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of all the enemies
I've fought until now,</font>

53
00:03:48,620 --> 00:03:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this guy's the strongest!</font>

54
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has 360-degree sight.</font>

55
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he unfailingly detects attacks</font>

56
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:02,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that penetrate the roughly
50 meter circumference around him.</font>

57
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But for some reason,</font>

58
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:08,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there were Kunai Knives
he couldn't evade completely.</font>

59
00:04:09,970 --> 00:04:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why couldn't he evade them?</font>

60
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:16,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he couldn't see them!</font>

61
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:21,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, even his Visual Jutsu
has a slight blind spot!</font>

62
00:04:22,860 --> 00:04:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being unable to see Kunai Knives
entering that blind spot,</font>

63
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's unable to react.</font>

64
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he was dealing with attacks
from the blind spot</font>

65
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with that defense technique.</font>

66
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I analyzed all the attacks
I carried out</font>

67
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and grasped them perfectly.</font>

68
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:43,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right behind his first thoracic vertebra...</font>

69
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there exists a blind spot expanding
from a very small point.</font>

70
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, if he moves and
doesn't stabilize the blind spot,</font>

71
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:04,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it becomes difficult to aim there
with an arrow.</font>

72
00:05:04,820 --> 00:05:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But such a trick... doesn't fool me!</font>

73
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist is pointless if
you don't come close to your enemy.</font>

74
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you can't afford to think about
approaching me at this point.</font>

75
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:21,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about how to escape now...</font>

76
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:26,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though whether you struggle or not,
you're going to die anyway.</font>

77
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... It seems you only
have a little Chakra left.</font>

78
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:39,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fate of the small fry character
in an easy game</font>

79
00:05:39,690 --> 00:05:41,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is to be destroyed right away!</font>

80
00:05:45,610 --> 00:05:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless!</font>

81
00:06:56,470 --> 00:06:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A thread?!</font>

82
00:06:59,020 --> 00:07:00,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, with this thread...</font>

83
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:07,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, the trajectory was thrown off
slightly by the trees, huh?</font>

84
00:07:16,450 --> 00:07:18,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case...</font>

85
00:07:18,370 --> 00:07:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll add some rotation this time.</font>

86
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So even if it hits a tree,</font>

87
00:07:23,710 --> 00:07:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it'll just cut through and the trajectory
won't be thrown off.</font>

88
00:07:27,590 --> 00:07:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as before...</font>

89
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll control the arrow up until
150 feet away from him</font>

90
00:07:32,970 --> 00:07:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using a thread with Chakra
flowing through.</font>

91
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take aim at the moving target...</font>

92
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:40,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and plunge the arrow into
the blind spot with a pinpoint attack!</font>

93
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's still standing up?</font>

94
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's strong...
He's much stronger than me.</font>

95
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:54,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hardly have any Chakra left now.</font>

96
00:07:55,570 --> 00:07:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I probably won't be able to evade
his next attack completely.</font>

97
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this it?</font>

98
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:04,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll win no matter what!</font>

99
00:08:11,010 --> 00:08:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... I wonder what you'd do.</font>

100
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:17,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had enough.</font>

101
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:22,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't dodge it anyway.</font>

102
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:32,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's stopped moving...
Has he given up?</font>

103
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But just to make doubly sure...</font>

104
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maximum destructive power
with 120% accuracy.</font>

105
00:09:02,350 --> 00:09:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got him!</font>

106
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:30,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it.</font>

107
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:32,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

108
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:11,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What? He still...?!</font>

109
00:10:11,380 --> 00:10:15,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! My attack just now
should've made the kill.</font>

110
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:18,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Substance with Chakra base...</font>

111
00:10:18,220 --> 00:10:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's meaningless against Gentle Fist.</font>

112
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist...</font>

113
00:10:22,890 --> 00:10:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, in his final moments,</font>

114
00:10:24,930 --> 00:10:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he funneled the last Chakra
through the thread!</font>

115
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:37,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eight crows...</font>

116
00:10:40,530 --> 00:10:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Again I couldn't see one of them.</font>

117
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to him?</font>

118
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He damaged several of
my internal organs.</font>

119
00:10:59,010 --> 00:11:01,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I can still move.</font>

120
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You failure...</font>

121
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:19,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you... I don't know when to quit!</font>

122
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you try to go against
your destiny that much?</font>

123
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I was called... a failure!</font>

124
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:38,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if you're going to say it's futile,
you don't have to do anything!</font>

125
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After I become Hokage,
I'll change Hyuga!</font>

126
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:46,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Ninjutsu that you're good at, huh?</font>

127
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was careless...</font>

128
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:55,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu was the Ninjutsu
I stunk at.</font>

129
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be whining about boring stuff
like destiny and what not,</font>

130
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and how it can't be changed!</font>

131
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike me,</font>

132
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're not a failure.</font>

133
00:12:15,130 --> 00:12:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

134
00:12:16,710 --> 00:12:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now it's become the three of us...</font>

135
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry about such things.</font>

136
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:24,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both Choji and Neji will
catch up right away.</font>

137
00:12:28,010 --> 00:12:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji had the trump card.</font>

138
00:12:30,850 --> 00:12:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I've fought Neji
in the Chunin exam, so I know...</font>

139
00:12:35,690 --> 00:12:36,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Know what?</font>

140
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That he's... a true genius.</font>

141
00:12:45,610 --> 00:12:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot lose...</font>

142
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:51,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whether he's an enemy
much stronger than me...</font>

143
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or even if this body should fail me...</font>

144
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot lose!</font>

145
00:12:58,170 --> 00:13:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a reason why I cannot lose!</font>

146
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:17,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had a hard time of it this time.</font>

147
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I played too long...</font>

148
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

149
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't build up Chakra...</font>

150
00:13:54,730 --> 00:13:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How? You should've
been instantly killed!</font>

151
00:13:57,810 --> 00:13:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How come you're alive?!</font>

152
00:13:59,730 --> 00:14:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't completely
evade it anyway.</font>

153
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:06,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I was prepared to deliberately
take the hit.</font>

154
00:14:07,530 --> 00:14:11,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I knew of my own weakness
much more than you do...</font>

155
00:14:12,450 --> 00:14:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There were eight crows, huh?</font>

156
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:18,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Byakugan has a blind spot.</font>

157
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, if I knew that your attack
would only come from there...</font>

158
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could release my Chakra just
to that blind spot and detect the attack.</font>

159
00:14:28,470 --> 00:14:29,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not so difficult to make</font>

160
00:14:30,010 --> 00:14:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a move of just a few inches
to throw off the aim.</font>

161
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:37,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd suffer a serious injury,
but instant death can be avoided.</font>

162
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:43,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you took the hit deliberately...?</font>

163
00:14:43,400 --> 00:14:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't change the fact
that you're going to die here.</font>

164
00:14:47,070 --> 00:14:48,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you go that far?!</font>

165
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:55,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Of all the enemies,"
you're the strongest I've ever fought...</font>

166
00:14:56,580 --> 00:15:00,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, there's a reason why I cannot lose.</font>

167
00:15:02,540 --> 00:15:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of all those I've ever fought,
the strongest one said this to me...</font>

168
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:16,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Unlike me... you are not a failure!
— Unlike me... you are not a failure!</font>

169
00:15:18,140 --> 00:15:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said that.</font>

170
00:15:21,230 --> 00:15:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been called a genius all along.</font>

171
00:15:24,610 --> 00:15:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I cannot lose.</font>

172
00:15:28,030 --> 00:15:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And for the sake of those guys
who believe</font>

173
00:15:29,950 --> 00:15:32,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that this humdrum and small me
is a genius!</font>

174
00:15:42,290 --> 00:15:45,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"The fate of the small fry character
in a game is to be destroyed right away."</font>

175
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:46,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said that, didn't you?</font>

176
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at this situation!</font>

177
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:06,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things like fate,
isn't determined by someone!</font>

178
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder...</font>

179
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:16,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You also look like
you're going to die!</font>

180
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, live.</font>

181
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than anyone in the clan,</font>

182
00:16:28,630 --> 00:16:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're the man loved most
by the Hyuga ability...</font>

183
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:38,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot die so easily.</font>

184
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you act tough,
you can't stem the current now...</font>

185
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-sama ran to
the Sound Village by his own wish.</font>

186
00:16:57,070 --> 00:17:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is now in the darkness...</font>

187
00:17:08,170 --> 00:17:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

188
00:17:11,630 --> 00:17:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... You've got better eyes than me.</font>

189
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a person who can find him
in the darkness and save him.</font>

190
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-sama belongs
to Orochimaru-sama.</font>

191
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter who it may be,
they can't save...</font>

192
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He can save him!</font>

193
00:17:41,950 --> 00:17:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because... Naruto... you...</font>

194
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:53,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saved me from the darkness!</font>

195
00:18:03,390 --> 00:18:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Talking rubbish until the end...</font>

196
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

197
00:18:10,650 --> 00:18:14,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't been pushed this far
since Kimimaro.</font>

198
00:18:22,200 --> 00:18:24,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

199
00:19:37,110 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone...</font>

200
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll leave the rest...</font>

201
00:19:45,950 --> 00:19:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to you.</font>

