<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#a7cce8">for the first time I spoke to you</font></b></font></font></font>

244
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yahoo! The enemies are quite close!</font>

245
00:22:42,250 --> 00:22:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">All right! We'll catch up in a burst!</font>

246
00:22:44,670 --> 00:22:46,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Speaking in terms of number,
we've got more!</font>

247
00:22:46,260 --> 00:22:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If things go well,
we can get him back next!</font>

248
00:22:48,090 --> 00:22:50,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yeah! I don't feel like losing
with four against two!</font>

249
00:22:51,010 --> 00:22:51,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Four against two?</font>

250
00:22:51,930 --> 00:22:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That's twice the opponents' number!</font>

251
00:22:53,010 --> 00:22:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey, hey. Were there four of us?</font>

252
00:22:54,430 --> 00:22:58,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Are you an idiot?!
Me, Akamaru, Shikamaru, and you!</font>

253
00:22:58,350 --> 00:23:00,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">No matter how you count,
there are four!</font>

254
